cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these data or code, please cite them as below."
title: "Concept Programming for Dependable AI: experimental data, case generators, pre-registrations, and analysis scripts"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Roth
    given-names: Frederick
    affiliation: "Independent researcher"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/ricodoco/safety-concept-experiment"
abstract: "Per-case scores, test sets, case generators, pre-registrations, and analysis scripts for four experiments on instilling behavioral constraints in language-grounded neural systems, including ten pre-registered ablation runs of the method's framing. Every number in the accompanying paper recomputes from the deposited per-case scores without a model. The training toolkit and adapter weights are not included."
keywords:
  - AI safety
  - fine-tuning
  - pre-registration
  - concept learning
  - language models
  - reproducibility
